2026-07-27T12:26:23.3045304Z i /tmp/Rtmppz4BSg/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3045638Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3046023Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3046373Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3046911Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3047692Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:26:23.3048609Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
